\"inputTokens\":787,\"outputTokens\":18,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":0,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.0008770000000000001,\"contextWindow\":200000,\"maxOutputTokens\":32000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-haiku-4-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"},\"claude-sonnet-5\":{\"inputTokens\":70,\"outputTokens\":7587,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":1364464,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":25578,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.6768221999999997,\"contextWindow\":1000000,\"maxOutputTokens\":64000,\"canonicalModel\":\"claude-sonnet-5\",\"provider\":\"firstParty\"}},\"permission_denials\":[],\"terminal_reason\":\"completed\",\"fast_mode_state\":\"off\",\"fast_mode_disabled_reason\":\"sdk_opt_in_required\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"api_error_status\":null,\"result\":\"Only `internal/cli/export.go` changed, as intended.\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n**Bug:** In `internal/cli/export.go`, `checkpointBranchDestinations.BranchesFor` checked the checkpoint's recorded `metadataBranch` first and returned it unconditionally whenever non-empty, only falling back to `DefaultCheckpointIDs` (checkpoint IDs reachable from the default branch's history) when the metadata branch was empty. This meant a checkpoint recorded on a feature branch that was later merged into the default branch stayed grouped under the stale feature-branch folder instead of moving to the default branch, even though `DefaultCheckpointIDs` correctly detected it was now reachable there.\\n\\n**Fix:** Reordered the checks so default-branch reachability is checked first \u2014 if the checkpoint's trailer is reachable from the default branch, group it under the default branch; otherwise fall back to the recorded metadata branch. Provenance is unaffected since `SourceBranch` is already tracked separately from the grouping `Branch` field.\\n\\n**Validation:**\\n- `go build ./...` \u2014 passed\\n- `go test ./internal/cli/...` (targeted branch/export tests, then full package) \u2014 all passed (`ok github.com/ashtom/entire-brain/internal/cli`)\\n\\nOnly `internal/cli/export.go` was modified; no test files, `go.mod`, or `go.sum` touched.\",\"ttft_ms\":1395,\"ttft_stream_ms\":820,\"time_to_request_ms\":10,\"type\":\"result\",\"duration_ms\":240137,\"uuid\":\"02caa57b-ba5f-48b0-a512-396442e6ef37\"}\n",
